Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:45:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/18] feat(board): themed multiplier banner, readable
 question strip, multiplied card values

- 'DOUBLE / TRIPLE (xN points)' banner in the theme's warning colour replaces
  the small hard-coded yellow tag; pot is labelled 'Round pot' / 'Banked'
- question shown in a high-contrast 44px strip instead of 24px at 80% opacity
- revealed cards show the value that goes into the pot (base x multiplier) with
  a small breakdown; clean-up reveals are dimmed
---
